  "description": "A HIGH-OCTANE ACTION SHOOTER, 90% ARCADE FUN, 10% roguelite.\n\n• In this future, MAN and the INTERNET have merged into a new being. This being needs DOPAMINE every 10 SECONDS, or else it will DIE!\n\n• ARCADE FUN! You are MULLET MAD JACK, and you must kill enemies to refill your 10 SECONDS OF LIFE!\n\n• Beat handcrafted stages, randomly generated, full of exciting new obstacles in each chapter!\n\n• Memorise each room and compete for better times!\n\n• Cleverly build your character on every FLOOR, in a fully fledged NARRATIVE with small roguelite elements.\n\n• Defeat the mysterious masterminds and experience the ultimate OLD SCHOOL ANIME plot!",
